From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zellij-zh-cn build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:04:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/20] i18n: translate remaining UI strings, wrap CJK by
 display width, position-independent key highlighting

- wrap previously untranslated literals in settings, themes, setup wizard, key/mouse bindings, session manager, about tips, bars, server modals and desktop integration
- highlight keys and phrases by content instead of hard-coded character positions (adds Text::color_keys to zellij-tile)
- share a display-width line wrapper (zellij_i18n::wrap_by_width) for text without spaces
- measure fit by display width where text is translated
